<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>CSS Styling SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14pt;
    color: white;
    background-color: black;
    text-align: center;
    margin-left: 8pt;
    margin-right: 8pt;
    margin-top: 2pt;
    margin-bottom: 2pt;
}

.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
.KRCC { Name: Korean; lang: ko-KR; SAMIType: CC; }

#Standard { Name: Standard; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 14pt; }
#LargePrn { Name: Large Print; color: #FFFF00; font-size: 18pt; }
#SmallPrn { Name: Small Print; color: #00FFFF; font-size: 10pt; }
#Source { color: red; background-color: blue; font-family: Courier; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: normal; text-align: left; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>The Speaker</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Welcome to the styled presentation</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>Dr. Smith</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>This subtitle uses CSS styling from HEAD</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=KRCC ID=Source>김 교수님</P>
<P Class=KRCC>이 자막은 HEAD의 CSS 스타일을 사용합니다</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC ID=Source>The Speaker</P>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Multiple style IDs are defined: Standard, Large, Small</P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Thank you for watching the styled demo!</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
